    <string name="s_about">About</string>
    <string name="about_text">Faisal AI Assistance\nVersion %1$s\n\nOne app for AI chat, visual search, text reading, translation, web, maps, background video and file sharing.\n\nSmarter Today • Better Tomorrow • Together\nPowered by faiNET</string>
    <string name="policy_text">Faisal AI Assistance has no accounts and does not send your data to faiNET.\n\nYour API keys, chats, notes and received files are stored only on this phone. Erase all data in Settings removes them.\n\nWhen you use AI Chat, Lens, Text Reader, Translator or AI Says, your text and photos are sent to the AI provider you chose (Cloudflare, Mistral or Google Gemini) to get an answer. Web searches are sent to Google or Tavily. Maps load from OpenStreetMap, and place searches go to its Nominatim service. Each of these services has its own privacy policy.\n\nThe camera, microphone and location are used only when you open a feature that needs them. BVR videos are saved on this phone and are not uploaded.\n\nShare Files sends files directly between phones on the same Wi‑Fi. The transfer is not encrypted.</string>
